# Stage 8: Bad Ischl (docs/game-design.md "Stage 8: Bad Ischl", D-092 ...
# D-098; as built: the D-096 "Stage 8 as built" addendum). 300 columns x
# 17 rows, side camera with camera_top 76 (D-103: the street, row 15, stays
# on screen); the street top is row 15 (rows 15-16), the goal
# square row 16. Columns are 0-based.
#   1 Katrin       0-39    kies. Start 2, Bus 150 / jetzt leer 5, Oblaten
#                          8-12 (row 13, clear of the bus board), M-box 14
#                          (row 11) between bricks, garden wall 18 (2 high)
#                          with an Oblaten arc. Statue block 22-23 (stone,
#                          2x2) under kaiser_jagdstandbild (col 21, dx 24 =
#                          centred on the block), taube_sitting at 23 row 11
#                          dy -5 (on the hat brim beside the crown: the seat
#                          is on the block's centre line, a cell centre is
#                          8 px off it, and the pigeon has no dx). Kaiser
#                          auf der Pirsch 26. katrin_talstation (back) col
#                          31 dx 8, its canopy oneway_wood 30-34 (row 11, 4
#                          up) with 4 Oblaten and a ?-box at 32 row 8.
#                          Kurgast #1 at 38 (walls: statue 23, bench 39):
#                          he walks left from the start, so a Resi who
#                          crosses the statue meets him under the canopy's
#                          left end and his chair is a step up through it.
#   2 Kaiserpark  40-99    kies. Kurgebiet 41, steps 42/43/44, terrace
#                          (meadow on stone) 44-53 top row 12, Habt Acht
#                          48 on it, 3 Oblaten 51-53. File A (lead 58, 59)
#                          on the avenue 54-66, penned by the terrace face
#                          and the fountain basin 67-71 (2 high, column 69
#                          3 high, Oblaten on it); an Oblaten arc 60-62
#                          over the file. Himmel 73, Kurgast #2 78 (walls:
#                          basin 71, step 84), Grundriss 80, kaiservilla
#                          (back) col 83 dx 48 = over the steps 84 (2) and
#                          85-87 (3 high, the refuge). Fiaker at 93: its
#                          trigger (128 px, centres) is reached on the
#                          steps from col 85.5 on.
#   3 Esplanade  100-159   bridge (jetty) 100-106 over the Ischl, promenade
#                          (ground on kai). seeauerhaus 112, Verlobt 110.
#                          Notch 1 119-121 (Traun, salzach_water), Kurgast
#                          #3 at 127 paces the landing 122-129 (ledge, bench
#                          130). Beste Ideen 133, lehar_villa col 134 dx 16,
#                          Selfie-Tourist #1 135 (bench 130, post block
#                          139). Notch 2 143-146 (4), landing 147-150,
#                          a stone kerb 151 (row 14, D-102: a Resi who
#                          walks left from the checkpoint stops there).
#                          Checkpoint 152, Bus 150 / fährt zurück 155,
#                          M-box 158 (row 11) between bricks.
#   4 Kurpark    160-219   cobbles to 173, then kies; the lawn (meadow)
#                          187-203. Trinkhalle 161, trinkhalle (back) col
#                          167 dx 8, 5 Oblaten, Trinkhalle steps 173 (2).
#                          Solebad 176. One pen 174-203 (steps 173, lawn
#                          wall 204, both 2 high) for Kurgast #4 (182) and
#                          file B (lead 198, 199, 200): they turn at each
#                          other, so the file turns at his deck chair and a
#                          held walking jump from the chair clears all
#                          three (the spec's 2-high flower urn at 186 was cut, so
#                          the file can reach the chair). Bandstand: floor
#                          oneway_wood 207-214 (row 13), roof roof_shingle
#                          207-214 (row 9, 6 Oblaten on row 8),
#                          musikpavillon col 210 dx 8, Blasmusiker 211 on
#                          the floor. The lawn wall stands 2 columns left
#                          of the floor so a hop over it lands on the
#                          street and Resi walks under the floor (with the
#                          wall at 206 the hop always landed on the floor,
#                          next to the musician under the roof). Wall steps
#                          216 (2) / 217-218 (3) right of it: from 217 the
#                          roof is 3 up (the only way onto it).
#   5 Theater    220-259   street. Hier singt 223, kongresshaus col 231
#                          (catalog placement), B1 balcony 225-229 (row 11)
#                          with Operettensänger #1 at 227, B2 232-237 with
#                          a flower box 232 (row 10), its stone end pier
#                          237 (rows 7-10) + bridge (236, row 8), D-102/E42:
#                          the Stollen's stopper; the Z-box at 235 row 8,
#                          Stollen 234.
#                          Operettensänger #2 at 245 (free street 239-244
#                          to his left), a 2-high bench 249-250, file C (lead 252, 253, phase 0)
#                          between the bench and the 3-high step 258-259.
#                          The bench is a perch between the two timings
#                          (with the file pacing up to the singer the
#                          solver's window there was 3 frames).
#   6 Pfarrgasse 260-299   cobbles. Zauner: anstellen! 262, planters 265
#                          and 275 (2) pen Selfie-Tourist #2 (270). Step
#                          278-279 (3), the Trafik: invisible 280-285 x
#                          rows 10-15 under the trafik prop (col 287 dx
#                          -72), roof 6 above the square, 3 Oblaten. The
#                          square (row 16) from 280, Maibaum 290, Café
#                          Zauner / gleich da 286 (street style, no
#                          Ortsende, D-097), zauner_fassade col 295 dx 8
#                          with the warteschlange in front (col 296 dx -8:
#                          same centre, spawned later, drawn later).
# Oblaten: 81 placed + 1 in the ?-box. Offizier phases all 0 (drill frame
# = clock - 1 + phase, E41). time_limit 210 (D-102; was 270): QA's
# relaxed run (qa_m6_bad_ischl_relaxed) took 69.67 s on the ZEIT clock.
# Solver (re-solved for D-102, E42): complete 1851, 17 jumps, narrowest 5
# (frame 1448, the running jump from B1 onto B2's flower box), then 7
# (1490, the hop from the flower box onto the Z-box top), 11 (1602,
# bench -> file C), 12 (1520, the leap off the box top over the pier and
# singer #2), 14; gate min_jump_window = 4 (D-092).
# Replays: tests/replays/bad_ischl_*.replay.

[meta]
id = "bad_ischl"
music = "bad_ischl"
title_key = "stage.bad_ischl.title"
time_limit = 210
min_jump_window = 4
camera_top = 76
background = [
  { sprite = "bg_sky_salzburg", factor = 0 },
  { sprite = "bg_katrin", factor = 3 },
  { sprite = "bg_badischl", factor = 13 },
]

[legend]
"_" = "kies"
"=" = "ground"
"," = "meadow"
"K" = "stone"
"#" = "kai"
"j" = "jetty"
"J" = "jetty_post"
"~" = "salzach_water"
"w" = "salzach_water_deep"
"+" = "oneway_wood"
"&" = "balcony"
"r" = "roof_shingle"
"I" = "invisible"
"B" = "brick"
"?" = { tile = "oblaten_box", contains = "oblate" }
"M" = { tile = "oblaten_box", contains = "mozartkugel" }
"Z" = { tile = "oblaten_box", contains = "zaunerstollen" }
"o" = { entity = "oblate" }
"P" = { entity = "player_start" }
"C" = { entity = "checkpoint" }
"G" = { entity = "goal_maibaum" }
"q" = { entity = "taube_sitting", dy = -5 }
"u" = { entity = "kurgast" }
"L" = { entity = "offizier", lead = true, phase = 0 }
"O" = { entity = "offizier", phase = 0 }
"D" = { entity = "offizier", lead = true, phase = 0 }
"E" = { entity = "offizier", phase = 0 }
"Y" = { entity = "offizier", lead = true, phase = 0 }
"y" = { entity = "offizier", phase = 0 }
"F" = { entity = "fiaker" }
"m" = { entity = "blasmusiker" }
"s" = { entity = "operettensaenger" }
"T" = { entity = "selfie_tourist" }
"1" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "kaiser_jagdstandbild", dx = 24 }
"2" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "katrin_talstation", dx = 8, layer = "back" }
"3" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "kaiservilla", dx = 48, layer = "back" }
"4" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "seeauerhaus", layer = "back" }
"5" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "lehar_villa", dx = 16, layer = "back" }
"6" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "trinkhalle", dx = 8, layer = "back" }
"7" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "musikpavillon", dx = 8, layer = "back" }
"8" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "kongresshaus", layer = "back" }
"9" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "trafik", dx = -72, layer = "back" }
"z" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "zauner_fassade", dx = 8, layer = "back" }
"Q" = { entity = "prop", sprite = "warteschlange", dx = -8, layer = "back" }
"a" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_bus", style = "bus" }
"b" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_kaiser" }
"c" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_kurgebiet" }
"d" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_habtacht" }
"e" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_himmel" }
"f" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_grundriss" }
"g" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_verlobt" }
"h" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_lehar" }
"i" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_checkpoint", style = "bus" }
"k" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_trinkhalle" }
"l" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_salzprinzen" }
"n" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_graf" }
"p" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_stollen" }
"v" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_anstellen" }
"x" = { entity = "sign", text = "stage.bad_ischl.sign_zauner" }

